# WASM build artifacts.
# web/public/projdesk.wasm IS tracked: CI deploys it directly so the pipeline does
# not depend on a specific MoonBit toolchain release (the compiler renamed the
# 32-bit integer type between releases, so rebuilding in CI is not reproducible).
*.wasm
!web/public/projdesk.wasm

